{"speciesId":429,"names":{"fr":"Magirêve","es":"Mismagius","en":"Mismagius","ja":"ムウマージ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its cries sound like incantations. Those hearing it are tormented by headaches and hallucinations."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It chants incantations. While they usually torment targets, some chants bring happiness."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its cries sound like incantations to torment the foe. It appears where you least expect it."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its cries sound like incantations to torment the foe. It appears where you least expect it."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Pareil à une incantation magique, son cri n’est que très rarement source de joie."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Pareil à une incantation magique, son cri n’est que très rarement source de joie."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il psalmodie des incantations. Ce sont souvent des malédictions, mais certaines apportent la joie."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Recita cánticos. Algunos de ellos atormentan a sus rivales, mientras que otros producen felicidad."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It chants incantations. While they usually torment targets, some chants bring happiness."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"じゅもんを 唱える ポケモン。 相手を 苦しめるもの だけでなく 幸せにする じゅもんも ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon insaisissable qui tourmente ses ennemis avec son cri semblable à une incantation."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Atormenta a sus rivales con gritos que parecen conjuros. Aparece en ocasiones y lugares imprevistos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its cries sound like incantations to torment the foe. It appears where you least expect it."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"じゅもんの ような 怪しい 鳴き声で 相手を 苦しめる。 神出鬼没の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il psalmodie des incantations. Ce sont souvent des malédictions, mais certaines apportent la joie."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Recita cánticos. Algunos de ellos atormentan a sus rivales, mientras que otros producen felicidad."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It chants incantations. While they usually torment targets, some chants bring happiness."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"じゅもんを 唱える ポケモン。 相手を 苦しめるもの だけでなく 幸せにする じゅもんも ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un Pokémon insaisissable qui tourmente ses ennemis avec son cri semblable à une incantation."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Atormenta a sus rivales con gritos que parecen conjuros. Aparece en ocasiones y lugares imprevistos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Its cries sound like incantations to torment the foe. It appears where you least expect it."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"じゅもんの ような 怪しい 鳴き声で 相手を 苦しめる。 神出鬼没の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Un Pokémon aux pouvoirs terrifiants : il sort de nulle part en maugréant des incantations et en lançant des malédictions."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Aparece de la nada sin previo aviso y lanza conjuros por medio de cánticos. Quienes los escuchan pueden sufrir terroríficas visiones."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It appears as if from nowhere—muttering incantations, placing curses, and giving people terrifying visions."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"どこからともなく 現れ 呪文を つぶやき 呪いを かけたり 恐ろしい 幻を みせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Comme Magirêve aurait le pouvoir de réaliser les souhaits des amoureux, certaines personnes se lancent désespérément à sa poursuite."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Es capaz de lanzar hechizos y conjuros de amor, por lo que hay gente totalmente obsesionada con encontrar a un Mismagius."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Mismagius have been known to cast spells to make people fall in love, so some people search for this Pokémon as if their life depended on it."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"恋の 願いが かなう 呪いを かけることも あるので 命懸けで ムウマージを 探す者も いる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Redouté pour ses sortilèges et ses malédictions, ce Pokémon peut néanmoins faire preuve de bienveillance, si l’envie lui en prend."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Es temido por su afición a lanzar maldiciones y conjuros a diestro y siniestro, pero a veces le da por usar la magia para ayudar a alguien."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Feared for its wrath and the curses it spreads, this Pokémon will also, on a whim, cast spells that help people."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"祟りや 呪いを 振りまくとして 恐れられて きた。 気まぐれに 人を助ける 呪文も 使う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il susurre des malédictions pour tourmenter ses ennemis et leur infliger de terribles migraines ou des hallucinations terrifiantes."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Murmura conjuros para atormentar al enemigo y provocarle dolores de cabeza insoportables o visiones terroríficas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its muttered curses can cause 